# Trivy ignore file — accepted CVEs per
# KNOWLEDGE-BASE/CONTEXT/PATTERNS/accept-with-rationale.md §
# "Entries from `trivy-prescan-2026-05-11`".
#
# Each entry is a CVE-ID, one per line. Trivy's CLI + Action both honour this
# file at the scan-context root. Update both entries simultaneously when the
# structural fix lands (revisit trigger: "scrub non-runtime packages from
