# lodash prototype-pollution (_.unset/_.omit). The advisory "fix" 4.18.0
# is an npm-flagged BAD RELEASE ("npm warn deprecated lodash@4.18.0: Bad
# release. Please use lodash@4.17.21"); 4.17.21 stays the trusted version.
# Not invoked with untrusted input here. Revisit when a trusted fix ships.
CVE-2026-2950
CVE-2025-13465

# brace-expansion DoS (zero-step brace range). Multi-major in the tree
# (1.x via workbox/glob + 2.x); forcing 2.0.3 BREAKS workbox's 1.x consumer
# (verified: build fails `brace_expansion.expand is not a function`).
# Build-tool only (not in the shipped SPA bundle); DoS input unreachable.
CVE-2026-33750

# picomatch method-injection. Multi-major (2.3.1 + 4.0.3); a single global
# override breaks one major's consumers. Build-tool only (glob at build,
# not shipped). Revisit with per-major targeted (nested) overrides.
CVE-2026-33672

